        "date": "2026-11-21T09:40:21Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): stamp each mill-turn operation that the posed law can read\n\n#3096 posts an unstamped rotary kind on a mill-turn in the mill order\n(rotary_traverse::mill_post_rotary), which reads the path. The stamp\ncannot read the path, so it now takes each mill and mill-turn setup as\nthe mill order: a word too many reads a cache Stale once; a word too few\nwould keep an unjudged cache fresh.\n\nRefs #3084\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
